{"3737310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parasite Elevator", "steam_appid": 3737310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space where parasites in human form lurk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped inside this bizarre and unsettling place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count the number of parasites hidden throughout the corridor, then use the elevator to proceed to the correct corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the wrong floor, and the elevator will begin to consume you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count the number of parasites lurking on the corridor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of parasites determines which floor you must go to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you choose the wrong floor even once, the elevator will consume you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue reaching the correct floors and escape from this disturbing space.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space where parasites in human form lurk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped inside this bizarre and unsettling place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count the number of parasites hidden throughout the corridor, then use the elevator to proceed to the correct corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the wrong floor, and the elevator will begin to consume you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count the number of parasites lurking on the corridor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of parasites determines which floor you must go to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you choose the wrong floor even once, the elevator will consume you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue reaching the correct floors and escape from this disturbing space.</p></li></ul>", "short_descript